      "text": "**Probably okay for a jog if you’re generally healthy**, especially around George Town: the latest nearby reading I found was **API 64 (“moderate”) at Minden at 11 p.m. on October 17**. That’s not pristine air, so consider an easier or shorter run rather than a hard workout. ([jerebumalaysia.com](https://jerebumalaysia.com/en/stations/minden-pulau-pinang/))\n\nIf you have asthma or another heart/lung condition, or you notice haze or irritation, skip the outdoor run. Readings vary across Penang—the latest city data showed **Bukit Mertajam at 118**, so check your immediate area before heading out. ([iqair.com](https://www.iqair.com/my-en/air-quality/malaysia/penang))",
